module jev_calibration_outcome_window_delta_observation_lsp

input status
input target_stage
input record_digest
input delta
input reason

status INFORMATION for BOUND signed outcome-window delta
status HINT for DEFERRED signed outcome-window delta
status ERROR for UNKNOWN or missing delta evidence

field code
field severity

constraint inspection_only
constraint signed_metric_projection
constraint no_improvement_claim
constraint read_only
constraint no_edits
constraint no_command
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
